{"name": "Voidloop", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voidloop is a mining adventure with roguelite and incremental elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a lonely Void Spirit who has wandered too far from home. Use your camp as a hub to prepare for each descent into ever-changing caves filled with rare loot and dangerous foes. Each dive brings you closer to your home at bottom of the cave...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Descend through 5 unique cave biomes,</strong> each filled with procedurally generated floors, unique hazards, and valuable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race against time</strong> as you push toward floor 20 of each cave to collect powerful gems and find your way back to the void.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Return to camp between runs</strong> to trade, craft, and upgrade your spirit with the help of the Blacksmith, Shopkeeper, and Witch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mine, fight, and loot</strong> over 60+ unique items, then progress your journey with 100+ upgrades and 34 powerful skills that make you stronger each run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803180/extras/9454445f95d82fa92a229910eb702636.avif?t=1781083767\" width=\"960\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"384\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803180/extras/bd843b1ecf3e0dd9fa440c4c0573b93f.poster.avif?t=1781083767\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803180/extras/bd843b1ecf3e0dd9fa440c4c057